"ein Beschwerderecht bei der zuständigen Aufsichtsbehörde (Österreichische "
"Datenschutzbehörde, <a href=\"%(authority_url)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">www.dsb.gv.at</a>) zu."
msgstr ""
"You have the right to access, rectify and erase your personal data and to "
"restrict its processing. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with "
"the competent supervisory authority (Austrian Data Protection Authority, <a "
"href=\"%(authority_url)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">www.dsb.gv.at</a>)."

