"Eligius-Datensätze."
msgstr ""
"Output as a clear matrix—every cell links directly to verified Eligius "
"records."

msgid "Hadrianus · Rom · ca. 119–121 n. Chr. (COS III)"
msgstr "Hadrian · Rome · c. AD 119–121 (COS III)"

